From df077b5fed582a0437149ee09d7ac45dab566af9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: aiaimimi0920 <153103332+aiaimimi0920@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 00:46:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Core: add scriptable process API

Port the legacy asynchronous child-process feature onto the modern OS pipe backends, including independent stdin closure and working-directory support.

Godot-Patch-Topic: runtime.process-api
